{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act43side_level_act43side_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act43side",
  "stageId": "act43side_07",
  "title": "“血鑽”的歌聲",
  "storyCode": "AD-7",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "738206461cb5e6982697edd237fdadfa1596c0bccc409def955dafa3aaea7672",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g8_mobileplotstreet_ruined"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是*藍卡塢片場術語*格蕾塔的拍攝計劃？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都貼在源石風暴的臉上了！明顯是想讓我們送死啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……不……一定是兇手幹的！你沒聽到之前的爆炸聲嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地塊的駕駛室被人為炸毀了……我們現在根本沒辦法改變地塊的移動速度和航向……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在地塊接觸的還只是天災的最外圍，等我們真的撞向它的正中心之後……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整個地塊可能連一塊完整的磚塊都不剩吧……嗚嗚嗚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了別說了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底是誰？連續死了這麼多人還不夠，現在還想帶走所有人的命嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無線電中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兇、兇手是道具組的莫伊拉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？誰在說話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說！地塊上發生的三起兇殺案，兇手就是莫伊拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫伊拉……天……就是那個不起眼的小札拉克？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格蕾塔女士親眼所見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是盧西恩先生在場，我們的製片人也遇害了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……那個混蛋在哪裡？我要去找她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你自己的命都快沒了，找一個喪心病狂的殺人犯理論還有什麼用！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道她不用付出一點代價嗎？如果有不知情的劇組成員又遇害該怎麼辦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你都能想到的問題，難道我想不到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了保命，我已經把無線電對講機調成廣播模式，真相現在應該已經傳到所有人的耳朵裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兇手絕不敢輕舉妄動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得保住自己這條值錢的命……等回到藍卡塢主城區，我就能用這幾天收集到的重磅八卦在汐斯塔買套度假別墅了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟了！地塊又往源石風暴的方向偏移了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，陸行艇！那些陸行艇能救我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……沒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "憤怒的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1845_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去緊急逃生艙看過了，所有的陸行艇都已經被源石風暴破壞了……沒有一架是好的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經無路可逃了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "害怕的工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1847_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……與其死在風暴裡，我還不如從地塊上跳下去……我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說傻話！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "攝影助理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1844_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快走，哪裡都比拍攝區安全，先到地下動力層躲一下！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g12_dressingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怖片的場景設計確實有很多值得參考的地方……謝謝你，蒂比。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小意思！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大致的呈現效果我需要先回去做一個樣本，等到斯蒂芬導演修改完劇本，我們再慢慢敲定細節。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我答應過您，一定會設計出讓“杜邦夫人”留名影史的落幕場景！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，合作愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（唉，已經這麼晚了嗎？不知道莫麗有沒有找到離開地塊的方法——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不太對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，米蘭妮女士，無線電有聲音……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無線電中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……天災……（雜音）……中控駕駛室……毀……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "訊號怎麼這麼差？這個聲音好像是阿布納的攝影助理？他又在亂傳什麼八卦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無線電中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中控駕駛室……炸毀了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無線電中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地塊……正衝向天災……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "無線電中的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……兇手……都是莫伊拉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蒂比緊握住無線電對講機，用力地轉動音量鍵，然而對講機裡只剩一片死寂……\n一定是自己聽錯了，她想。\n可是，米蘭妮女士為什麼要這樣憂鬱地看著自己？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……不可能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蒂比……沒有人會在這個節骨眼開玩笑……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是……莫麗根本沒有作案的時間啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝莉、邁克爾、瑪麗昂遇害的晚上，她一直都跟我待在一起看電影，根本沒機會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "真的沒機會嗎？\n蒂比在心中質問自己。\n每次看電影莫麗都會陪自己整個晚上，寸步不離嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我們每次都是好幾部恐怖片一起看，所以她偶爾會在換光碟的時候，稍微離開一陣子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有時候是說格蕾塔女士有事找她，有時候說東西還放在拍攝現場，要回去拿……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "米蘭妮女士，你知道的，她剛當上道具組長，壓力很大，很認真地對待自己的工作……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對不對，這最多只能說她具備犯案的條件，並不能直接證明她就是兇手啊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "動機呢？她為什麼要殺這些與她毫不相關的人？為什麼我什麼事情都不知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，或許，你只是沒那麼瞭解自己的朋友……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我們把注意力放在電影啦……莫麗，你不要老是分心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，劇組最近發生的事情太多了，我……我有點緊張……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有我在你身邊啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管我是什麼身分，在這個劇組裡，我都是你最好最好的朋友！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g12_dressingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又或許，莫麗她，從來都沒把我當成，朋友……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她只是想，利用我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黎博利女孩把頭垂得很低。\n她再也說不出一句話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "米蘭妮抱住了眼前小小的黎博利。\n幾個小時前還在安慰她的女孩，現在靠在自己的肩頭哭泣。\n米蘭妮輕撫著女孩的後背，她沒有再追問什麼，也沒有幫對方總結所謂成長的代價，只是抱著她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於現在，蒂比，跟我離開這裡吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "建築內複雜的結構太多，如果地塊繼續靠近天災中心，這裡會變得很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們要快點去地下避難，雖然地塊的航向不變的話，這麼做也無濟於事……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "地下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "越過米蘭妮的肩頭，蒂比看到了她們剛剛從恐怖片中整理出的資料。\n“地下”這個關鍵詞在她的腦海中盤旋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，我明白了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？這麼快就恢復情緒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我是想到改變地塊航向的辦法了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有個劇組曾經為了省掉地塊租金，偷偷潛入藍卡塢另一個地塊的地下結構拍攝實景，完成了一部很酷的恐怖片……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我最近才又看過一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個地塊和我們腳下的這個地塊，是藍卡塢出產的同一批拍攝用地塊……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說，它們的規格和框架是差不多的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我沒有猜錯……動力層的深處應該有一個備用的機械控制室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米蘭妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1830_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……有幾成把握？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說實話……完全沒有把握。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我必須去做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些事情，胡思亂想是得不到答案的。只有等到危機解決之後……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂比",
      "speakerId": "avg_4191_tippi_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才能去找她問清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g6_proproom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（溫柔的歌聲♪）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（清亮的口哨♪）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧西恩先生，你來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是姐姐她最喜歡的歌，拍戲的空檔，她經常望著天空哼著這首歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為，你已經清醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實已經清醒了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多虧了你，讓我看到了被自己視而不見的真相……它們真是，太殘忍了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你現在，是在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "轟隆隆的聲響自腳下傳來，這座藍卡塢地塊正朝著天災加速狂奔，人們都在驚慌避難，不會再有工作人員試圖來到道具間……\n然而就在此時，道具師做起了她的本職工作。\n她在道具間來回穿梭，擺布著一個又一個道具人偶，為它們穿上衣服，為它們糾正姿勢……專注而認真。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在剛剛，我終於想起自己是怎麼認識勞拉的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "容我猜測……你遇見了一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，一位很溫柔的菲林。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那天天氣很差，我在長椅上坐了很久，我的臉上有水，應該是雨滴，或者眼淚……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明是那個負責人的疏忽導致了事故，但最後，賠光了錢還被趕出劇組的，是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在藍卡塢沒認識多少人，這樣的事情已經經歷過很多次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是從家鄉逃出來的，爸爸媽媽死後，我已經無處可去，只剩下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後那個人在旁邊坐了下來，我們全程沒有說一句話，他只是溫柔地等我平復下來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他離開之後，我發現自己的膝蓋上多了一個錄影帶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "62_g6_proproom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個人在我看不見任何光亮的時候，將勞拉帶進了我的人生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勞拉成為了我的姐姐，她守護著我、鼓勵著我，讓我一點點重新振作起來……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個時候，勞拉早已死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勞拉的出身、經歷甚至長相都與你相似，那個人為你帶來了身處絕境所必需的動力……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也為你帶來了憤怒、困惑、刻骨的仇恨和復仇的渴望……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毫無疑問，那是另一種絕境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盧西恩先生，你的眼神中閃過了一絲哀傷……不對，是憐憫？也不對……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更像是一種了然於心，一種感同身受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在你的身上，發生過類似的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你認識那個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他擅長將一段本不存在的喜怒嫁接進你的人生，就像一個恣意妄為的導演，蠻橫地在一個他認為乏味的故事裡融入……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，用我新學會的電影術語來說——“即興創作”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他將你拉出絕境，又引導你踏進另一種絕境，由此來激發所謂戲劇的美。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……他是我的舊識，我的老師，我所有痛苦的根源，一個本應早已死去的幽靈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到你，找到他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我為此而來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "莫伊拉，很遺憾否定了你的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是這樣的，盧西恩先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫伊拉擺正了最後一個人偶，回到了道具間的正中央。\n她朝盧西恩施了一個禮，輕輕扣了扣指尖。\n盧西恩在一瞬間覺察到了異樣，抬眼望去，所有的人偶都“活”了過來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不認為你否定了我什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我人生最絕望的時候，勞拉出現在我的身邊，陪伴我度過了漫長時光……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "勞拉就是我的姐姐，我就是勞拉的妹妹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不後悔為她報仇，我不後悔背負這些罪孽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我會成為這片大地上最後一個記得她的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我哭、我笑、我憤怒、我疑惑、我憎恨、我悲哀、我懷念……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我因此擁有了，我本無法擁有的一切強烈體會——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我活著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人偶們動了起來。\n盧西恩認出了人偶的原型……那是死去的道爾頓、謝莉、邁克爾和瑪麗昂，以及，她自己。\n莫伊拉伸出手臂，與經過自己身邊的人偶逐一相挽，錯身。\n沒有音樂配合，地面也在晃動，但小小的札拉克道具師此刻仿若成為了世間最忘情的舞者，她與萬千個人相擁……\n詭異而優雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實我應該感謝你，盧西恩先生，你讓我意識到……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“莫伊拉”已經什麼都不剩的時候……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得自己變成了一面鏡子，我可以是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "任何人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盧西恩",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1828_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因絕望而生的滿足，只是毒藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的人生再也沒有哪一刻比現在更清醒了，盧西恩先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也要，成為我的舞伴嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫伊拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1831_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……像它們一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫伊拉話音落下的瞬間，她的舞伴們撲向了盧西恩——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
